  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Specialised 3D reconstruction tool for surgical planning and biomedical research — notable for STL/mesh export for 3D printing of anatomical models. GPL-2.0, 785 stars, government-maintained (CTI Renato Archer, Brazil). Marked Assess rather than Adopt because release pace has slowed (v3.1.99998, April 2024) and the tool is more niche than general-purpose DICOM viewers. Strong in global south and 3D-printing-for-medicine contexts.",
